WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
June 1816.

2
00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:06.260
A villa by a lake, at
night, in pouring rain.

3
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:12.210
Inside, by candlelight, a challenge:
"We will each write a ghost story".

4
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.380
Cut to a lecture theatre: a covered table,

5
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.930
two metal rods, a spark.

6
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.300
Then an old book: Paradise Lost.

7
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:26.470
Readers in 1818 opened this new novel
knowing things you probably don't.

8
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.920
What did they know?

9
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.920
In this mission, you'll go back
to that rainy summer of 1816,

10
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.400
when Mary Shelley was just eighteen.

11
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.580
You'll meet galvanism,
named after Luigi Galvani,

12
00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:41.610
who reported his electricity
experiments in 1791.

13
00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:47.340
And you'll open Milton's Paradise Lost,
a poem from 1667 that runs right through

14
00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.200
the novel.

15
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.850
Your mission: work out what a
reader in 1818 knew that you don't.
